message: "If you use this project in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Laya-GAL: Route Reachability Prediction for Japanese Visual Novels"
abstract: >-
  A multi-game, decision-point-aware binary classification model that predicts
  whether a candidate route in a Japanese visual novel remains reachable after
  the current player choice, given the story state and current option.
type: software
